comment on table greendogops.ezyvet_invoice_summary is
  'One row per INVOICE (ezyvet_invoice_line holds the line detail, this holds the header). Adds what lines cannot answer: status (Approved/Pending), credits vs debits, amount still due, due date, and the pet the invoice was for. Re-read on a rolling window and upserted, because invoices flip from Pending to Approved days later.';

